cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "FishingROD"
version: "2.2"
abstract: >
  A Python tool for processing GID (Grazing Incidence Diffraction) data
  from MaxiPix detectors. The script identifies peak images in Q-space,
  sums them while using non-peak images as background, and performs
  Gaussian fitting on the resulting data.
authors:
